        "@value": "CCA,CDCA [cytosol] + ATP [cytosol] + CoA-SH [cytosol] => PPi [cytosol] + AMP [cytosol] + H2O [cytosol] + choloyl-CoA; chenodeoxycholoyl-CoA [cytosol]"
