        "@value": "(S)-3-Hydroxydodecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + NAD+ [mitochondrial matrix] => 3-Oxododecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + NADH [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix]"
