        "@value": "Coactivators of PPARalpha [nucleoplasm] + PPARA:RXRA:Corepressors [nucleoplasm] + FABP1:ligands of PPARA [nucleoplasm] => PPARA:RXRA Coactivator complex [nucleoplasm] + Corepressors of PPARalpha [nucleoplasm] + FABP1 [nucleoplasm]"
