      {
        "@value": "5beta-cholestan-7alpha,12alpha,27-triol-3-one [cytosol] + NADPH [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol] => 5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,27-tetrol [cytosol] + NADP+ [cytosol]"
