        "@value": "O2 [cytosol] + 24OH-CHOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + hydrogen donor [cytosol] => CHOL7a,24(S)DIOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + hydrogen acceptor [cytosol] + H2O [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol]"
