        "@value": "4C4MZYMOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NADP+ [cytosol] => NADPH [cytosol] + dh4MZYMOL [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + CO2 [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol]"
