        "@value": "GLA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + NADPH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + Malonyl-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] => NADP+ [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + H2O [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + CO2 [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + DGL-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen] + CoA-SH [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]"
