        "@value": "O2 [cytosol] + CYB5B:Fe2+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + DHCE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + H+ [cytosol] => CYB5B:Fe3+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + (4E)-CERA [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + H2O [cytosol]"
