        "@value": "CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix] + 3a,7a-dihydroxy-5b-cholest-24-one-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] => propionyl CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + chenodeoxycholoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]"
