        "@value": "O2 [cytosol] + 2-saturated fatty acid [cytosol] + CYB5B:Fe2+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + H+ [cytosol] => CYB5B:Fe3+ [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + 2-OH FA [cytosol] + H2O [cytosol]"
